d":3668528422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7aqU0m","user":{"login":"jellowyellow","id":80075542,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDc1NTQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80075542?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow","html_url":"https://github.com/jellowyellow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T06:03:44Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T06:03:44Z","body":"I've now found found the culprit: The editor setting `text_editor/behavior/files/auto_reload_and_parse_scripts_on_save`. When this setting is toggled off, the bug manifests.\n\nThe setting's description is: `If true, tool scripts will be automatically soft-reloaded after they are saved.`, which doesn't describe the buggy behavior, so i think it accidentally messes with the script creation process.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3668528422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3669260578","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114137#issuecomment-3669260578","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114137","id":3669260578,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7atHki","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T09:15:38Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T09:15:38Z","body":"> 4.6 dev 1 and onwards\n\nTo confirm, you tested in 4.5.1 and it doesn't occur there?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3669260578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3670404959","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114137#issuecomment-3670404959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114137","id":3670404959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7axe9f","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","