owing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T20:00:21Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T20:00:21Z","body":"> > 4.6 dev 1 and onwards\n> \n> To confirm, you tested in 4.5.1 and it doesn't occur there?\n\nThat was the case before, but I've now tested on 4.5.1 with the problematic setting toggled off, and the bug also occurs there. I'll check to see if there's a specific version where this stops happening.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3672011860/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3672102090","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114137#issuecomment-3672102090","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114137","id":3672102090,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7a39TK","user":{"login":"jellowyellow","id":80075542,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDc1NTQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80075542?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow","html_url":"https://github.com/jellowyellow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jellowyellow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T20:27:51Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T23:36:36Z","body":"After some trial and error, i can confirm that this bug starts to happen on version `4.4 dev 3` and later, and does not happen on `4.4 dev 2` and earlier (Though of course I did not test every version in existence).\n\nThis was tested on Linux Mint (Ubuntu 22.04) and on Windows 10, with the exact same results.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3672102090/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4120292717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114137#issuecomment-4120292717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114137","id":4120292717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71lq1t","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T17:56:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T17:56:02Z","body":"`ScriptLanguage::make_template` is supposed to return a script. But since it does not recieve a path we can't return a shallow script. What we return is a script with just the source code set, which has no place in the `GDScriptCache`. Down the line this leads to two scripts being created for the same path since the first script of the path can not be located through the cache.\n\nFrankly I don't think there is a good minimal solution to this. We need to move away from using `Script` in the script editor APIs.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4120292717/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]